# %% [markdown]
## 2. Install packages, configuration, Drive, secrets and reproducibility tools

Colab ships PyTorch, torchvision, transformers, scikit-learn, pandas, matplotlib and plotly. The cell adds the rest. Versions actually resolved are written to the freeze manifest (§22). GPU: A100 (40 or 80 GB) recommended; L4 works (2-3× slower); without a GPU, deep-model cells are recorded as **Not Run (no GPU)**, never as zeros.

